aether-vc1
==========

A pure Rust SMPTE 421M (VC-1) Advanced Profile video decoder.

This crate is a derivative work of the VC-1 decoder in FFmpeg (libavcodec), release 7.1:
  vc1.c, vc1.h, vc1dec.c, vc1_block.c, vc1_loopfilter.c, vc1_mc.c, vc1_pred.c, vc1_pred.h,
  vc1data.c, vc1data.h, vc1_vlc_data.h, vc1acdata.h, vc1dsp.c, msmpeg4_vc1_data.c, wmv2data.c,
  hpeldsp.c / hpel_template.c (half-pel motion compensation) and the h264chroma template
  (bilinear chroma motion compensation).
The control flow, the integer arithmetic and the constant tables (generated into src/tables.rs by
tools/gen_tables.py directly from those files) follow the FFmpeg sources so that the output is
bit-identical.

